<title>UK: TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the DFS</p>
<p>CLassic women's grass-court tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Samantha Smith (Britain) 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Nicole Arendt (U.S.) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech Repubic) 6-3 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) beat Lucie Ahl (Britain) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Sandra Cacic (U.S.) beat 11-Els Callens (Belgium) 6-3 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Laura Golarsa (Italy) beat 13-Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Kristine Kunce (Australia) beat Wiltrud Probst (Germany) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Kristina Torrens-Valero (Spain) beat 12-Alexandra Fusai (France) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>8-Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Kerry-Anne Guse (Australia) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>14-Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat Magui Serna (Spain) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Olga Barbanschikova (Belarus) beat Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-3) 4-6 9-7.</p>
</text>
